# ============================================================
# KREDENSIAL GITHUB CONTAINER REGISTRY (ghcr.io)
# ============================================================
# Salin file ini menjadi ".token" (hapus kata .example)
#
# Cara membuat Personal Access Token (PAT) Classic di GitHub:
# 1. Buka: https://github.com/settings/tokens/new
# 2. Note: Konveksi Client Token
# 3. Expiration: No expiration (atau 1 tahun)
# 4. Centang checklist: [x] read:packages
# 5. Klik "Generate token" di bagian paling bawah
# 6. Salin token ghp_xxxxxx ke bawah ini:
# ============================================================

GITHUB_USERNAME=tirta7
GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_masukkan_token_classic_di_sini
